Add the Backup API (`/v20/backups/...`): clients of teams with the `automaticBackups` feature can upload the full backup file of an epoch and upload incremental files under the full of an epoch, list and download the files of an epoch, and list the restorable epochs of all clients of the user (`GET /backups`) or of one client (`GET /backups/clients/<cid>`). Files are stored in S3 (prefix `backups/`) and tracked in PostgreSQL. Clients can delete their backups (`DELETE /backups/clients/<cid>`); deleted, replaced and stale backup files are removed from S3 immediately.
